                  <paragraph>10 mL single dose vial per carton.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">To report SUSPECTED ADVERSE REACTIONS, contact BPI Labs LLC at 727-471-0850 or FDA at 1-800-FDA-1088 or <content styleCode="italics">www.fda.gov/medwatch</content>. </content>
                  </paragraph>
